  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In multiplication and division, the result must be reported with no more significant figures as in the measurement with few significant figures</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>02858</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>112</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5702</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>000561</mn></math></p><p>(Or) Reported answer should not be more precise than the least precise term in calculations, so there should be three significant figures in reported answer.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
